Name = "Archer Quendi"
texture = ExtResource("7_54xf4")
Description = "Pilgrims strung with bows of forest yew and spider silk. They shoot from where they stand, at any foe they can see, but they're lightly clad, poor with a knife, and too busy with their arrows to strike back when an enemy reaches them. Keep them behind the warriors."
